  "releaseNotes": "'# [8.0.0-prerelease.1](https://github.com/smartive/zitadel-net/compare/v7.0.44...v8.0.0-prerelease.1) (2026-06-08)\n\n\n* chore(deps)!: upgrade to .NET 10 and refresh NuGet packages ([20422c3](https://github.com/smartive/zitadel-net/commit/20422c368c5b7eac45d65b31c9492ced2955e0ed))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **api:** enhance gRPC client support and versioning ([3e3ce34](https://github.com/smartive/zitadel-net/commit/3e3ce34ae7a4f13eab4b5f04dff40dd8202c7a1a))\n\n\n### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* The Zitadel package now targets net10.0 and no longer supports net8.0 consumers.\n\n\n\n'",
